  Run Title:
     1 km resolution CALMET simulation for 4 hours from 5AM January 9, 1990          
     with MM4 data, 5 surface met stations, 1 overwater station,                     
     3 upper air met stations, and 16 precip stations                                

                                                                                                                                     
                                                                                                                                     
