        to surface station for which extrapolation                                                                                   
        of surface winds at surface station will be allowed                                                                          
        (RMIN2: Set to -1 for IEXTRP = 4 or other situations                                                                         
         where all surface stations should be extrapolated)                                                                          
                                              Default: 4.     ! RMIN2 = -1.0 !                                                       
                                                                                                                                     
